### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@greenly.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Me
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me

### Create microclimate
POST http://localhost:5000/api/microclimates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Balcony",
  "environmentType": "outdoor",
  "weatherAware": true,
  "weatherLocation": "Warsaw, Poland",
  "temperature": 18,
  "humidity": 60,
  "lightLevel": "Medium"
}

### Catalog
GET http://localhost:5000/api/catalog

### Create plant
POST http://localhost:5000/api/plants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "microclimateId": 1,
  "externalSpeciesId": "ficus-lyrata",
  "nickname": "Ficus in bedroom",
  "notes": "Gift from mom, needs extra care"
}

### Dashboard
GET http://localhost:5000/api/plants/dashboard

### Log care action
POST http://localhost:5000/api/plants/1/care-actions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskTypeKey": "water",
  "notes": "Soil was very dry"
}
